      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Sounds useful. Pull the title out of the stream metadata, though, so that it doesn't rely on a particular video site to work.\n\nI'd also just make the title and whatever else appear inside Text components, so that the map maker can show or hide them as they want. I was trying to set up complicated triggers to do exactly this, but there were some complications.",
