  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-09-16T16:31:01.252Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "In my opinion, having the title and the name of the channel in the video would be very useful, often it happens that, after watching the video or listening to the music from VRChat you want to go to see the channel or in any case give a like to the video, and beyond this would be even more correct against those who posted a video. And instead of always being on top of the video maybe just make it appear on the video screen and disappears after a few seconds",
